{"text":"Now, when men say it, it is usually about something that they should not be doing anyway. Sometimes the say to their friend, it's something to say to their friends in a kind of fondly exasperated way, you know, something that ultimately proves how masculine they are, how needed, how loved. Oh, my wife said I can't go to the club every night, so for peace in my marriage, I do it only on weekends. Now, when a woman says I did it for peace in my marriage, she's usually talking about having giving up a job, a dream, a career. We teach females that in relationships compromise is what women do. We raise girls to see each other's competitors, not for jobs of accomplishments, which I think can be a good thing, but for the attention of men.","words":[{"text":"Now","start":0.76,"end":1.12,"punct":","},{"text":"when","start":1.24,"end":1.32},{"text":"men","start":1.32,"end":1.62},{"text":"say","start":1.62,"end":2.04},{"text":"it","start":2.04,"end":2.36,"punct":","},{"text":"it","start":2.5,"end":2.62},{"text":"is","start":2.62,"end":2.74},{"text":"usually","start":2.74,"end":3.04},{"text":"about","start":3.04,"end":3.22},{"text":"something","start":3.22,"end":3.5},{"text":"that","start":3.5,"end":3.7},{"text":"they","start":3.7,"end":3.84},{"text":"should","start":3.84,"end":3.96},{"text":"not","start":3.96,"end":4.22},{"text":"be","start":4.22,"end":4.4},{"text":"doing","start":4.4,"end":4.62},{"text":"anyway","start":4.62,"end":5.12,"punct":"."},{"text":"Sometimes","start":8.76,"end":9.12},{"text":"the","start":9.12,"end":9.48},{"text":"say","start":9.48,"end":9.76},{"text":"to","start":9.76,"end":10.0},{"text":"their","start":10.0,"end":10.2},{"text":"friend","start":10.2,"end":10.5,"punct":","},{"text":"it's","start":10.62,"end":10.74},{"text":"something","start":10.74,"end":10.9},{"text":"to","start":10.9,"end":11.06},{"text":"say","start":11.06,"end":11.22},{"text":"to","start":11.22,"end":11.34},{"text":"their","start":11.34,"end":11.5},{"text":"friends","sta